'''TARMA''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 216
|rarity = RR
|name1 = TARMA
|name2 = TARMA CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''TARMA CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
TARMA is essentially a slightly longer-ranged [[Li'l Gross Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Macho Legs]], at least in terms of knocking back Aliens. His Area Attack makes him quite good at doing so, as well. However, knocking back Aliens is typically a bad thing because of their numerous backliners. If you would need to knockback an Alien though, [[Ancient Egg: N105 (Rare Cat)|Racquet Cat]] is more useful because she attacks twice.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

